00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:08,960
Slide 26 presents a compelling "REAL-WORLD CASE STUDY: Executive Inbox Triage: Reclaiming 15 Hours Every Week."

2
00:00:09,660 --> 00:00:26,290
Look at the left card tagged "BEFORE": "Manual Triage." An executive spends 2.5 hours every single morning manually opening 150 emails, sorting spam, downloading attachments, and drafting routine confirmations.

3
00:00:26,990 --> 00:00:44,150
Now look at the right card tagged "AFTER": "Avatar Automation." The personal avatar executes at 4 AM, categorizes all 150 emails, drafts polite replies for approval, extracts urgent action items, and places a 1-page briefing doc on Google Drive!

4
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:52,165
When the executive arrives at their desk at 8 AM, they review the entire briefing in just 10 minutes.

5
00:00:52,165 --> 00:00:57,670
That reclaims over 15 hours of high-value leadership time every single week.

6
00:00:58,370 --> 00:01:03,190
That is the tangible, real-world ROI of building agentic workflows.

